{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02416",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 3.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Afternoon, thanks for coming in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.29,
      "end_seconds": 7.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.61,
      "end_seconds": 12.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Okay, what would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.66,
      "end_seconds": 18.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "So, I've been getting puffed climbing stairs, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.55,
      "end_seconds": 20.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.32,
      "end_seconds": 26.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "About... well, four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.98,
      "end_seconds": 37.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.52,
      "end_seconds": 53.81,
      "duration_seconds": 15.29,
      "text": "Yeah, I notice it more with stairs. Honestly, on and off. I get some relief from resting. Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.74,
      "end_seconds": 57.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.73,
      "end_seconds": 86.0,
      "duration_seconds": 26.27,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a bit of a cough with exercise as well. As for feeling unfit, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. The bit of a cough with exercise? That's been for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.37,
      "end_seconds": 97.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.64,
      "end_seconds": 100.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.59,
      "end_seconds": 108.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.25,
      "end_seconds": 118.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Yes, you know, I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.92,
      "end_seconds": 121.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.41,
      "end_seconds": 125.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I have acid reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.54,
      "end_seconds": 127.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.68,
      "end_seconds": 136.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for five years. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.16,
      "end_seconds": 143.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.36,
      "end_seconds": 162.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.34,
      "end_seconds": 166.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.33,
      "end_seconds": 169.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.5,
      "end_seconds": 174.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.75,
      "end_seconds": 177.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.63,
      "end_seconds": 183.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.57,
      "end_seconds": 203.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Okay, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.38,
      "end_seconds": 215.31,
      "duration_seconds": 9.93,
      "text": "It's pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity. I'm supposed to take it regularly, but I don't always manage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.0,
      "end_seconds": 220.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Right, have you had any chest pain or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.28,
      "end_seconds": 229.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.13,
      "end_seconds": 234.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Alright, have you noticed wheeze or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.57,
      "end_seconds": 240.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Ah, I haven't had wheeze or palpitations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.4,
      "end_seconds": 243.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.1,
      "end_seconds": 246.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.64,
      "end_seconds": 250.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.22,
      "end_seconds": 253.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.65,
      "end_seconds": 261.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.24,
      "end_seconds": 270.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.05,
      "end_seconds": 291.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.43,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 16, pressure 111 over 82. And heart rate 82, saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.85,
      "end_seconds": 297.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.7,
      "end_seconds": 301.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.56,
      "end_seconds": 325.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and your oxygen level is normal at rest and after walking."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.75,
      "end_seconds": 345.41,
      "duration_seconds": 17.66,
      "text": "You can relax now. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is breathlessness from low fitness. Another possibility is mild asthma. I think a peak flow makes sense here, for exertional cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 350.5,
      "end_seconds": 352.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "The earliest is Friday, 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.65,
      "end_seconds": 371.99,
      "duration_seconds": 17.34,
      "text": "Build up to thirty minutes of brisk walking five days a week. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.08,
      "end_seconds": 375.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.36,
      "end_seconds": 381.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.86,
      "end_seconds": 385.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 386.51,
      "end_seconds": 388.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Okay, all the best."
    }
  ]
}